  "code" : "public List<Integer> primeFactors(int n) {\n    List<Integer> factors = new ArrayList<>();\n    int remaining = n;\n    for (int i = 2; (long) i * i <= remaining; i++) {\n        while (remaining % i == 0) {\n            factors.add(i);\n            remaining /= i;\n        }\n    }\n    if (remaining > 1) {\n        factors.add(remaining);\n    }\n    return factors;\n}",
